## Test Suite Design Plan for comfyui_3D_viewport

### 1. Directory Structure

```
C:\Users\User\comfyui_3D_viewport\
  tests/
    __init__.py                  # empty
    conftest.py                  # sys.path, shared fixtures
    test_math_utils.py           # Priority 1 - pure math
    test_config.py               # Priority 1 - config constants
    test_selection.py            # Priority 1 - ray casting, AABB, selection manager
    test_animation.py            # Priority 1 - camera animator, interpolation
    test_undo.py                 # Priority 1 - undo stack, commands
    test_camera.py               # Priority 2 - orbit camera
    test_projection.py           # Priority 2 - physical camera projection
    test_lighting.py             # Priority 2 - light rig, presets, uniforms
    test_usd_loader.py           # Priority 2 - triangulation, normals (mock pxr)
    test_mesh_importers.py       # Priority 2 - trimesh loading (mock trimesh)
    test_file_drop.py            # Priority 2 - path normalization, format detection
    test_shading.py              # Priority 3 - mode enum, cycling, properties
    test_hud.py                  # Priority 3 - build_camera_info, toggle
    test_environment.py          # Priority 3 - preset config, mode cycling
  pytest.ini                     # or pyproject.toml [tool.pytest.ini_options]
```

### 2. conftest.py Design

